## 3. Domain Pattern Rules

**Domains should:**
- Operate on in-memory records (no DML, no UOW)
- Be reusable across services / controllers / triggers
- Encapsulate business logic

```apex
public class Fixtures extends fflib_SObjectDomain implements IFixtures {
    
    public void updateScores(Integer homeScore, Integer awayScore) {
        for (Fixture__c fixture : (List<Fixture__c>) Records) {
            fixture.Home_Score_Total__c = homeScore;
            fixture.Away_Score_Total__c = awayScore;
        }
        // ❌ No DML here - caller registers with UOW
    }
}
```

