## 5. Feature Flags & Record Type Guards

Check at method start with early returns:

```apex
public static void setContractDate(List<Opportunity> opportunityList) {
    if (!FeatureFlagCustomMetadata.getFeatureFlag('FEATURE_NAME') || opportunityList == null) {
        return;
    }
    
    Id recordTypeId = Utils.getRecordTypeId('Opportunity', 'RecordTypeName');
    
    for (Opportunity opp : opportunityList) {
        if (opp.RecordTypeId == recordTypeId) {
            // logic
        }
    }
}
```

